# Nothing about a real installation belongs in this repository. The ids,
# the names and the deploy targets live in gitignored local files, and the
# credentials live in Worker secrets. A local file is the easiest way to
# leak one by accident, so every one of them is listed here.
.dev.vars
.env
.claves.env
wrangler.local.jsonc
wrangler.executor.local.jsonc
*.local.*
.respaldos/

# The sync from the private panel this code comes from. The rules and the
# deny list name exactly what must not be published, so they cannot be
# published either. See SYNC.md.
sync.local.mjs
deny.local.json
.sync-state.local.json
.sync-staging/

# La memoria de Claude sobre este proyecto: nunca al repo.
memoria/
LEEME.md
